5,0,1,talk,Sakura,,Hi everyone! This is going to be so exciting! I wonder who the big bad wolf is? Maybe we can play a game to find them! What do you all think we should do first?,"{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Minato,,"A game? That sounds fun, Sakura. But... I'm not sure how a game would help us find the wolf. Does anyone know a way to make the wolf reveal themselves?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Takumi,,Games are a waste of time. We need to be serious if we want to win. Let's just start questioning everyone's behavior and find the wolf as fast as possible. Who's with me?,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm with you on being serious, Takumi, but let's not be too scary! Maybe we can look for contradictions in what people say? I'll do my best to help us find the wolf!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's keep it logical. Emotional reactions are noise. I'll be observing your speech patterns and consistency. If anyone's logic falters or they contradict themselves, that's where we'll find our answer. Proceed as you like.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Takumi, you're so serious! It's like talking to a teacher! @Shion, ""speech patterns"" sounds like a magic trick! Do you think you can tell if someone is lying just by how they talk? That's so cool!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Minato,,"@Shion, is that really possible? I've never heard of that before. I want to learn how to do it too, but... I'm worried I might misunderstand someone's feelings and think they're lying when they aren't.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura, stop joking around! @Minato, worrying won't save us. If we spend all our time talking about ""magic tricks"" and ""feelings,"" the wolf is just going to laugh at us. We need a real plan now!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're right that we need a plan! How about we all share our thoughts on who seems the most suspicious as the day goes on? That way, we can compare notes and find the wolf together!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, sharing thoughts is a basic start, but subjective ""suspicion"" is unreliable. I'll be looking for those who try too hard to lead the conversation or those who are overly defensive. Let's see who breaks first.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you're like a detective! I want to be a detective too! @Mio, sharing thoughts sounds like a great idea! Who do you think is the most suspicious so far? I can't tell at all!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Minato,,"@Mio, I'm not sure if I can tell who is suspicious yet... everyone seems so different. Do you really think we can find the wolf just by talking for a little while? I'm a bit scared of making a mistake.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, stop being such a coward! Being scared is exactly how the wolf wins. We don't have time for doubt. If you can't decide, then just follow my lead and let's get to the point!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're so pushy! @Minato, it's okay to be nervous, we're in this together! I don't have a suspect yet, but I'll be watching everyone closely. Let's just stay positive and keep talking!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, your urgency is noted, but pushing others too hard can be a tactic to rush a decision and hide the truth. I'll be watching to see if that aggression is a mask for something else.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, wow! You're even watching Takumi! This is getting really intense, like a movie! @Takumi, are you really a secret wolf? Just kidding! I'll follow your lead since you're so confident! What's the plan for tomorrow?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Minato,,"@Sakura, you're so brave to joke like that... @Takumi, if you have a plan, I'll try my best to follow it. But... what if we accidentally vote for a nice person? I hope we can all be careful.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, stop whining about ""nice people""! We're here to win, not make friends. Tomorrow, we analyze every word and vote out the most suspicious person immediately. No hesitation. That's the only way to survive.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're way too intense! But I agree we need to be careful tomorrow. Let's all try to remember everything said today so we can spot any lies. Good luck everyone, let's do our best!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Mio,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, your desire for a swift execution is efficient, but efficiency without accuracy is just a gamble. I've noted everyone's baseline today. Tomorrow, the real analysis begins. I'll be waiting for the first slip.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Shion,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
