34,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"Good morning everyone! Did you all sleep well? I had a funny dream about a wolf wearing a hat! @Shion, did you find any ""slips"" yet? I'm so curious to know what you've discovered!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Minato,,"@Shion, did you really find something already? I... I don't think I noticed anything strange, but maybe I'm just not looking at it the right way. Could you explain what you mean by a ""slip""?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"@Shion, stop playing riddles and just spit it out! If you've found something, tell us now. We agreed to be efficient. Every second you waste talking in circles is a second the wolf uses to hide!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're still so impatient! But actually, I have some really important information. I'm the Seer, and I checked on Takumi last night... and he's the Werewolf! Everyone, we found him!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Shion,,"@Mio, that is a very bold claim to make so early. While the result is convenient for the group, we must consider if this is a genuine revelation or a calculated move to force a quick execution. @Takumi, your reaction will be telling.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Mio, what?! You're the Seer? That's so cool! But @Takumi is the wolf? No way! He's so scary, I thought he was just a grumpy teacher! Is it really true, Mio? Everyone, what do we do now?","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Mio, are you really sure? I... I want to believe you, but it's so sudden. What if you're mistaken, or what if someone else is pretending? I don't want to hurt Takumi if he's actually a human.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Mio, you're lying through your teeth! You're just trying to frame me to look like a hero! @Minato, stop being so naive! She's obviously the wolf or the possessed trying to get rid of me! Don't listen to her!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, stop shouting! I'm not lying! I saw the truth with my own eyes last night. @Minato, I'm absolutely sure! Please trust me, we can't let the wolf trick us just because he's acting loud and angry!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, your reaction is predictably aggressive, which fits your established baseline. However, @Mio, claiming the Seer role so early is a high-risk, high-reward strategy. If you are lying, you've painted a target on your back. Let's analyze the logic.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you're always thinking so hard! It's like a puzzle! @Mio, if you're really the Seer, then we're so lucky! But @Takumi is so loud, it's hard to tell who's lying. What do you guys think? Should we believe Mio?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Minato,,"@Mio, I want to trust you, but @Takumi sounds so sure that you're lying... I'm really confused. @Shion, you're the smartest one here, do you think Mio is telling the truth? I don't want to make the wrong choice.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Takumi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"@Minato, stop relying on Shion for everything! Use your own head! @Mio is just using a fake role to manipulate you all. It's a classic trick! If we vote me out, we lose a human and the wolf wins!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Shion"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, you're just trying to confuse everyone because you're caught! @Minato, please don't be swayed by his anger. I'm telling the truth to save us! If we don't vote him out now, he'll just attack more of us tonight!","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Shion,,"@Minato, don't let your confusion cloud your judgment. @Takumi, your defense is purely emotional and lacks a counter-argument beyond ""she's lying."" If @Mio is the wolf, she's played a dangerous hand. If you are, you're simply desperate. I'm leaning toward Mio.","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"@Shion, you're leaning toward Mio? Then it must be true! @Mio, you're so brave for telling us! Sorry @Takumi, but if the detective and the Seer agree, I have to believe them! Let's vote for Takumi!","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Minato,,"@Shion, if you think Mio is telling the truth, then... I guess I should believe her too. I'm still a little scared, but I don't want to put everyone in danger. I'll vote for Takumi.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Mio"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"@Sakura @Minato You're both pathetic! You're just following Shion like sheep! @Mio, you've played us all for fools with your fake act! If you execute me, you're throwing away a human! You're all making a huge mistake!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Minato"",""Shion"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,Mio,,"@Takumi, calling us names won't change the truth! I'm doing this to protect everyone. @Sakura, @Minato, thank you for trusting me! Let's be brave and vote him out together to save the village!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Sakura"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Shion,,"@Takumi, your insults are a poor substitute for a logical defense. You've provided no evidence to contradict @Mio's claim, only noise. The probability of @Mio risking her position as Seer this early if she were the wolf is low. I vote Takumi.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
